      "skos:definition": "The DPI-H Reference Architecture draft's own glossary and shared Digital Transformation Handbook (DTH) concepts as a SKOS scheme, one concept per term (folio/dpi-h-ra/glossary/, from the review draft who-dpi-h-reference-architecture-draft-v1, together with shared concepts across dth-phc 9789240093362-eng, dth-sc 9789240101197-eng, dth-pc 9789240116191-eng, dth-sfp 9789240120747-eng, and dth-hrh 9789240107588-eng). KG concept prefLabels are Capitalized (owner ruling, 2026-10-31). Definitions are verbatim; where sources define a term differently, every competing wording is recorded with its source in scopeNote as a cited alternative and none is chosen (smart-ra#133 S1, smart-ra#139, smart-ra#140, smart-ra#142, smart-ra#143).",
