      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "An electronic record of health-related information that can be created, gathered, managed, and consulted by authorised clinicians and staff within one health care organisation."
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "EMR",
      "skos:scopeNote": "Defined in Appendix C (Lifelong Health Record, Terminology and Scope) citing the ONC/NAHIT definition, and contrasted with EHR, SHR, and LHR. Also used across the Digital Transformation Handbooks. A candidate until the RA editors adopt it through the public review.",
